  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「やれやれ……。よっこらしょ、っと」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（ったくもう、屋上までの階段をのぼるだけで一苦労だわ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（むかしは一段飛ばしで、あっという間に辿りついたもんなのに）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（老いを感じるわ～、マジで……。あぁ、腰が痛い）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（近ごろ座り仕事ばっかりだしね、体力が落ちてるのかしら。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（腹筋と背筋をほどよいバランスで鍛えないと、腰痛になるのよね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（あたしも、ちょっと筋トレとか走りこみでもしようかしら。まだ暑い季節だし、しんどいけど。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（あたしが舞台に立てば、トミ子も一緒に……って感じだし？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（舞台に立つのは、嫌だけど。万が一に備えておかないとね、役者不足は今に始まった話じゃないし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "（念のためね、あたしでも賑やかし程度にはなるでしょ）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「……ん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あぁ、転校生。何してんのよ、こんなところで座りこんで。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あんまり屋上には入らないほうがいいわよ、あちこち老朽化してるからさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「……入り浸ってる、あたしが言えた義理じゃないけどね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ジュース、飲む？　あたしの『飲みさし』だけど、こんな良い天気じゃ喉渇いてるでしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「熱中症とかで倒れたら、みんなが心配するわよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「噂には聞いてるのよ～、『みんなの転校生くん』なんでしょ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「うん、よし。飲め飲め、……あぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あたし、今さら間接キッスで頬染めるほど純情じゃねぇわよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「……んあ、何よ。寝不足でひっどいクマができてるんだから、あんまり見ないでよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「デリカシーないわね、そういうところは『あいつ』そっくりだわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ん？　そ～よ、名乗ってなかった？　あたし、湖南やこ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「何よ、初めて会ったような顔しちゃってさ？　これまで、何度もあちこちで顔あわせてるでしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あぁ、わりと『ふたりきり』で話したことはなかったかしら？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「こっちも、用事がなけりゃ話しかけないしね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あんたと仲良しっぽい三波さんのほうには、よく衣装づくりとか頼んでるから頻繁に会ってるんだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「んん？　あぁそういえば、あんたアンジーの弟だっけ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ふぅん……あいつが部屋に飾ってる写真に、昔のあたしと一緒にいるやつがあったのね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「そんなもん後生大事に抱えてんのね、あいつ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「過去なんかさっさと振りきって、新天地で幸せになりゃいいのに。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「未練たらしいっていうか、あいつらしいけどさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「昔は昔、今は今でしょ。同時に、あいつはあいつであんたはあんたよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「血縁なんて幻想だし、あんたがあいつの弟だから何だっていうの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ふぅん。血は繋がってないんだ、じゃあなおさら関係ないじゃないの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ちづるやクロはどうか知らないけどさ、あたしは『そのへん』に折りあいをつけたつもりよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ううん。無理やりにでも折りあいつけて、転がりながらでも前に進むしかねぇのよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「それで、血だるまになってもさ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「トミ子やあんたが、そんな『あたしたち』の屍を越えていってくれたら本望だわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「そうやって、あたしたちが辿りついた到達点から羽ばたいて……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「とびっきり、良い景色を見てくれたらいいわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「それよりも、さっきから聞こえてるこの歌声は何なの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「下の階まで響いてたわよ、あんたが歌ってた……わけでもないわよね？　女の子の、声だしね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「音楽でも聞いてるのかと思ったら、そうでもないし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ん～、不気味ね？　もう、怪談の季節は終わったわよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あれっ、長居さん。あの子、何であんな給水塔の天辺なんかで歌ってるの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「うん。以前、歌劇をやったときに助っ人を頼んだことがあるのよ。ちょっとした、顔見知りっていうかね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「歌劇をやったあとも、あの子ったら何がお気に召したんだか……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「食堂とか、廊下とかで会うたびに話しかけてくるのよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「理由もわからずに懐かれるのは、気味が悪いったらないわ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ちょっと変わった子よね、長居さんって……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ふぅん、あんたクラスメイトなの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「仲良しなんだ、放課後にこんなところで『ふたりきりのリサイタル』ってか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「青春しちゃってるわね～、あぁ暑苦しい。……んん？　そういう関係でもない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「どういうことよ、ズバッと言いなさいズバッと！　苛々する！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あぁ……。そっか、長居さんって合唱部だっけ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「うん、『文化部部長会議』ってのがあってさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「その影響で、ほとんどの文化部は『てんやわんや』してるのよ。とくに合唱部は、酷い状態みたいね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ほら……。あたしはそのころ海外だったから詳しくは知らないけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「『暗黒文化祭』とかいうのがあったらしいじゃない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「その中心になってたのは、文化系の部活なんでしょ。演劇部とか、美術部とかさ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
